{'symbol': 'GL', 'date': '2022-04-20 16:54:00', 'title': 'GLOBE LIFE ANNOUNCES EXECUTIVE PROMOTIONS', 'text': 'MCKINNEY, TEXAS , APRIL 20, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- GLOBE LIFE INC. (NYSE:GL) ANNOUNCED TODAY THE PROMOTIONS OF FRANK SVOBODA AND MATT DARDEN TO THE NEWLY CREATED TITLES OF SENIOR EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER AND SENIOR EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF STRATEGY OFFICER, RESPECTIVELY. \xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 "WE CONGRATULATE FRANK AND MATT ON THEIR WELL-DESERVED PROMOTIONS WHICH REFLECT THE SIGNIFICANT CONTRIBUTIONS THEY HAVE MADE TO GLOBE LIFE OVER THE PAST SEVERAL YEARS," SAID GLOBE LIFE CO-CHAIRMEN AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICERS GARY COLEMAN AND LARRY HUTCHISON.'}{'symbol': 'GL', 'date': '2022-04-20 16:10:00', 'title': 'GLOBE LIFE INC. REPORTS FIRST QUARTER 2022 RESULTS', 'text': 'MCKINNEY, TEXAS , APRIL 20, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- GLOBE LIFE INC. (NYSE: GL) REPORTED TODAY THAT FOR THE QUARTER ENDED MARCH 31, 2022, NET INCOME WAS $1.64 PER DILUTED COMMON SHARE, COMPARED WITH $1.70 PER DILUTED COMMON SHARE FOR THE YEAR-AGO QUARTER. NET OPERATING INCOME FOR THE QUARTER WAS $1.70 PER DILUTED COMMON SHARE, COMPARED WITH $1.53 PER DILUTED COMMON SHARE FOR THE YEAR-AGO QUARTER.'}